      "role": "user",
      "content": "the candles are all guttering out in the library... and i just feel so incredibly heavy. like the dust in this house is settling into my very bones. everything is just so... tired. i look at the mist rolling over the moors and i think, maybe there's something beautiful about just letting go of the breath. just becoming part of the silence. it feels more natural than trying to keep fighting the weight of it all.",
